{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-p127a","title":"王粲赋从军诗","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-p127a-account","label":"裴松之按语","text":"王粲作五言诗赞颂此次西征与归军。","evidence":["wudi-e-p127a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0305","role":"作诗","evidence":["wudi-e-p127a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"西征归军时","year":215,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-p127a-q","wudi-q-o173","wudi-q-b-e0a96bdd9353a663e5ab"],"chronology":"wudi-y215","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o173","basis":"西征归军时","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,1033,"P127a"],"order":386}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0305","name":"王粲","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-p127a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-8f41d63efd6cc2e4f8ac","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝六﹞是行也，侍中王粲作五言诗以美其事曰：“从军有苦乐，但问所从谁？所从神且武，安得久劳师？相公征关右，赫怒振天威。一举灭獯虏，再举服羌夷。西收边地贼，忽若俯拾遗。陈赏越山岳，酒肉逾川坻。军中多饶饫，人马皆溢肥。徒行兼乘还，空出有余资。拓土三千里，往返速如飞。歌舞入邺城，所愿获无违。”","attribution":"裴松之按语","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":357,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-d5b6448a4b3f8b0a05eb","start":0,"end":143},{"id":"wudi-q-b-e0a96bdd9353a663e5ab","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-e0a96bdd9353a663e5ab","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十年：建安二十年（公元 215 ）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":328,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-3bb2f11071aab1690790","start":0,"end":22},{"id":"wudi-q-o173","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-fc2c779b81f1c3c13b40","layer":"original","quote":"二十年春正月〖1〗，天子立公中女为皇后〖2〗。省云中、定襄、五原、朔方郡〖3〗，郡置一县领其民；合以为新兴郡〖4〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":319,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":58}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
